        {
          "text": "Jia Abibu, jia isani lafa Misiri keesaa baatani, jila Qit'a bukho inqamne akuma anini qara isaniini jed'e naa tolcha. Qit'a bukho qabu guyya torba ka jila tana inyaatina. Nami tokoleeni harka duwa na dura ind'ufini.",
          "type": "text",
